# Lighting showcase: Wave A point/spot lights, soft shadows, ACES
# tonemapping, linear fog, PBR standard materials and a PPM texture.
# One still frame (no animation): a textured checker cube flanked by a
# glossy dielectric sphere and a fully metallic sphere on a ground
# plane that receives their shadows.
scene "lighting-showcase" size 640 480 background black fog linear near 30 far 80 tonemap aces shadow soft
camera at 5 3 7 look 0 -1 0
light spot at -3 6 4 look 0 -1 0 angle 40 penumbra 0.5 intensity 60 decay 2
light point orange at -5 1 4 intensity 40 distance 0 decay 2
light ambient strength 0.15
plane ground gray at 0 -2 0 size 16 material standard metalness 0 roughness 0.95
cube checker_cube white at -3.2 -1 0 size 2 material standard metalness 0 roughness 0.8 texture "assets/checker.ppm"
sphere glossy_ball blue at 0 -1 0 radius 1 material standard metalness 0 roughness 0.15
sphere metal_ball gray at 2.8 -1.1 0 radius 0.9 material standard metalness 1 roughness 0.3
render
